- `apps/graph-manager/src/server/auth.ts` (whole file, 169 lines) — `needsAuth` (59–67), `needsSameOrigin` (80–85), `originAllowed` (92–103), the `onRequest` hook in `authRoutes` (119–126), `passwordMatches` (46–50, the constant-time pattern with `timingSafeEqual`).
- `apps/graph-manager/src/server/app.ts` (lines 138–157) — `authRoutes` is registered first; feature routes are registered one line per feature (lines 144–157). Register `tokenRoutes` and `v1Routes` there. The error handler (105–122) turns a `ZodError` into `400 {"error":"<path>: <message>"}`, so `schema.parse(req.body ?? {})` is all the validation code a route needs.
- `apps/graph-manager/src/server/routes/reviewers.ts` — a small cookie route module to mirror (export `async function xRoutes(app, ctx)`).
