- `apps/graph-manager/src/web/pages/SandboxCard.tsx` (lines 1–80) — a self-loading Settings card: loads on mount with `api()`, keeps a `loadError`, saves with `post()`, toasts with `useToast()`.
- `apps/graph-manager/src/web/pages/Settings.css` (lines 1–30) — `.settings-card`, `.settings-card-head`, field and button classes to reuse.
- `apps/graph-manager/src/web/ui/Dialog.tsx` — `ConfirmDialog` (used by the GitHub Disconnect in Settings.tsx 159–168); use it for Revoke.
